flowchart LR
    user[Technical Colleague]
    cli[Run Command<br/>python -m pipeline.run_pipeline]
    acquire[Acquire Module<br/>sample or live FRED observations]
    raw[(Raw JSON Artifact)]
    transform[Transform Module<br/>clean + derive GDP indicators]
    transformed[(Transformed JSON Artifact)]
    report[Reporting Module<br/>markdown run summary]
    summary[[Pipeline Summary Report]]
    fred[(FRED API<br/>optional live source)]

    user --> cli
    cli --> acquire
    acquire -->|solid: required data flow| raw
    acquire -.dotted: optional live call.-> fred
    raw -->|solid: required handoff| transform
    transform -->|solid: required output| transformed
    transform -->|solid: metrics + flags| report
    report -->|solid: required output| summary

    subgraph legend[Legend]
        l1[Rectangle = executable module]
        l2[(Cylinder = persisted artifact or external store)]
        l3[[Rounded box = generated document]]
        l4[Solid arrow = required synchronous flow]
        l5[Dotted arrow = optional external dependency]
    end
